<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-5 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">About Corecloud365</h2>
  <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    <strong class="font-semibold text-[#111827]">Corecloud365</strong> is a cloud services provider managing infrastructure for mid-market enterprises. They handle everything from cloud migration to ongoing operations, supporting hundreds of virtual machines, databases, and applications across multiple cloud providers.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">The challenge</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    As Corecloud365 scaled, their operations team struggled to keep up. Troubleshooting required searching through logs across dozens of systems. Documentation was scattered, and tribal knowledge lived in senior engineers' heads. When issues occurred, resolution time depended on who was on-call.
  </p>
  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-red-200 bg-red-50 p-6">
    <p class="mb-2 text-[14px] font-medium text-[#111827]">Key pain points:</p>
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-[14px] text-[#6B7280]">
      <li>&bull; Mean time to resolution (MTTR) averaged 4 hours</li>
      <li>&bull; Documentation spread across 5 different systems</li>
      <li>&bull; Junior engineers needed constant help from seniors</li>
      <li>&bull; Recurring issues weren't captured systematically</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">The solution</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Corecloud365 deployed Zunkiree Search to create an AI-powered operations assistant. Engineers can now describe problems in natural language and get relevant runbooks, past incident reports, and troubleshooting steps instantly. The system learns from resolved incidents to improve future recommendations.
  </p>
  <div class="space-y-3">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 font-medium text-[#111827]">Unified knowledge search</p>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] text-[#6B7280]">All documentation, runbooks, and incident reports searchable from one interface with natural language queries.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 font-medium text-[#111827]">Intelligent troubleshooting</p>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] text-[#6B7280]">"Database connection timeout on production" returns relevant past incidents and resolution steps.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 font-medium text-[#111827]">Automated documentation</p>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] text-[#6B7280]">Resolved incidents are automatically indexed, making tribal knowledge searchable.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">The results</h2>
