<div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-8 shadow-subtle" data-reveal>
  <blockquote class="mb-4 text-[19px] italic leading-relaxed text-[#111827]">
    &ldquo;Our junior engineers can now resolve issues that used to require senior intervention. The AI finds the right documentation instantly, and we've cut our operational costs dramatically.&rdquo;
  </blockquote>
  <p class="text-[14px] text-[#6B7280]">
    <strong class="font-semibold text-[#111827]">VP of Engineering</strong><br>
    Corecloud365
  </p>
</div>

